{
  "_comment": [
    "示例 —— 正常情况下【不需要】手工编辑这个文件。",
    "`python hosts/workbuddy/install.py --apply` 会自动把这一条写进 ~/.workbuddy/mcp.json，",
    "command 与 MARCH7_HOME 都由本机解析结果渲染（ADR-0055 决策 1）。",
    "只有需要手写配置时才参考这里：<REPO> 换仓库绝对路径、<HOME> 换用户目录，",
    "路径用 `/`（Windows 钩子经 Git Bash 执行，反斜杠会被吃掉）。"
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "March7": {
      "command": "<REPO>/.venv/Scripts/python.exe",
      "args": ["-m", "March7"],
      "env": {
        "MARCH7_HOME": "<HOME>/.March7",
        "PYTHONIOENCODING": "utf-8",
        "PYTHONUNBUFFERED": "1"
      }
    }
  }
}
